#. ja: こちらは、旅籠「九つの雲」でございます。<br>申し訳ございませんが、只今準備中でして……。
#. de: Willkommen in der Herberge „Zum Wolkenschäfchen“, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>.
#. fr: Bienvenue à l'auberge des Neuf-Nuages.<br>Je suis désolé, l'ami<if $gn4>e</if>, mais je crains nous n'ayons pas de chambre libre en ce moment.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_1:1"
msgid "Beggin' your pardons, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, but if it's a room you're here for, I'll have to ask you to wait."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ご用意ができるまで、今しばらくお待ちください。
#. de: Im Moment kann ich dir leider noch kein Zimmer anbieten ... Kann ich dir vielleicht auf andere Weise helfen?
#. fr: J'espère que vous ne nous en tiendrez pas rigueur.
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_2:1"
msgid "Or is there some other way in which I can assist you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何を聞く？
#. de: Was möchtest du fragen?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous savoir<nbsp>?
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_00061_Q1_000_1:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 旅籠「九つの雲」とは？
#. de: Was ist die Herberge „Zum Wolkenschäfchen“?
#. fr: Quel genre d'endroit est l'auberge des Neuf-Nuages<nbsp>?
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A1_000_1:1"
msgid "Ask about Cloud Nine."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A1_000_2:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この旅籠「九つの雲」は、<br>皇都「イシュガルド」での宿泊施設として、<br>旅する皆様に、ご愛顧いただいております。
#. de: Na, die Herberge ist eine Herberge! Und das Wolkenschäfchen erfreut sich unter den Bürgern Ishgards besonderer Beliebtheit.
#. fr: Ah, voilà une question qui me plaît<nbsp>!<br>Cette auberge est indéniablement le meilleur endroit à Ishgard pour passer une nuit reposante.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_3:1"
msgid "Well, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, some might say that Cloud Nine is an Ishgardian institution. Been here longer than most folk can remember, we have."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まるで「九つの雲」に包まれたかのような、<br>ふわふわのベッドをご用意しておりますので、<br>至福のひとときをお過ごしください。
#. de: Wir rühmen uns damit, die weichsten Betten diesseits des Schicksalswegs zu haben, und unsere Gäste neigen dazu, uns Recht zu geben.
#. fr: Tout comme le nom de “Neuf-Nuages” le suggère, nos lits sont ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment douillets. Et pour cause<nbsp>! Nous rembourrons nos matelas avec le meilleur duvet de chocobo que l'on puisse trouver en Éorzéa<nbsp>!
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_4:1"
msgid "There's some debate as to the meanin' of the name. Some say it's 'cause sleepin' in a bed of ours is like being wrapped in linens made of clouds."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ご用意ができ次第、ご案内いたしますので、<br>今しばらくお待ちください。
#. de: Wie auf Wolken gebettet wirst du dich fühlen - daher kommt auch der Name!
#. fr: Ne vous inquiétez pas, vous aussi, vous aurez l'opportunité de passer la nuit chez nous, dès que nous aurons une chambre libre pour vous.
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_5:1"
msgid "Others think anyone who believes that rubbish ought to try spendin' a night in the Brume."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それでは、どうぞごゆっくり、おくつろぎくださいませ。
#. de: Statte uns doch bitte bald wieder einen Besuch ab. Ich werde dafür sorgen, dass du ein Zimmer mit Ausblick über das Wolkenmeer bekommst.
#. fr: En attendant, n'hésitez pas à vous réchauffer près du feu.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_6:1"
msgid "Me, I say a bed's a bed. I think ours are better than most, but I'm not about to get into a pissin' contest to prove it─ Er, beggin' your pardons, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらは、旅籠「九つの雲」でございます。<br>ご用件を承ります。
#. de: Willkommen in der Herberge „Zum Wolkenschäfchen“, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>.
#. fr: Bienvenue à l'auberge des Neuf-Nuages.<br>Dites-moi, que puis-je faire pour vous, l'ami<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>?
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evenin'<else>mornin'</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evenin'</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>evenin'<else>mornin'</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evenin'</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_10:1"
msgid "A fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evenin'<else>mornin'</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evenin'</if></if> to you, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>. How may I assist you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_Q2_000_1:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 客室に移動する
#. de: Ein Gästezimmer beziehen.
#. fr: Aller dans ma chambre
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A2_000_1:1"
msgid "Retire to an inn room."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 客室での禁止事項について聞く
#. de: Etwas darüber erfahren, was in den Zimmern verboten ist.
#. fr: En savoir plus sur les in<shy>ter<shy>dic<shy>tions
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A2_000_3:1"
msgid "Ask about inn rules."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 旅籠「九つの雲」とは？
#. de: Etwas über die Herberge „Zum Wolkenschäfchen“ erfahren.
#. fr: Savoir quel genre d'endroit sont Les Neuf-Nuages
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A2_000_4:1"
msgid "Ask about Cloud Nine."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_A2_000_5:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ご宿泊でございますね。<br>お客様のお部屋はこちらになります。<br>どうぞ、ごゆっくりおくつろぎくださいませ。
#. de: Bitte sehr, hier entlang. Ich habe ein Zimmer mit Ausblick über das Wolkenmeer bereitgestellt. Aber bitte halte die Verschläge verschlossen - wegen der Drachen.
#. fr: Dans ce cas, reposez-vous bien. Je suis sûr que le lit moelleux que nous avons mis à votre disposition vous fera faire de beaux rêves.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_11:1"
msgid "Yes, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>. Very good, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>. Right this way, if it please."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 申し訳ございませんが、旅籠「九つの雲」では、<br>客室での「製作」を禁止させていただいております。
#. de: Ich muss dich daran erinnern, dass es auf den Zimmern strengstens verboten ist, Synthese zu betreiben.
#. fr: Pour votre gouverne, sachez qu'il n'est pas permis de faire des travaux d'artisanat dans nos chambres.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_17:1"
msgid "Generally speakin', <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, what you do in the privacy of your own room is none of our concern, so long as it doesn't disturb our other guests."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作中の物音が、お休み中の他のお客さまのご迷惑となります。<br>よりよい休息のため、お客様のご協力をお願いいたします。
#. de: Die Geräusche, die dabei entstehen, würden die anderen Gäste stören. Bitte habe dafür Verständnis.
#. fr: Le bruit que cela produit gêne en effet les autres clients... qui viennent ensuite se plaindre à moi.
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_18:1"
msgid "Certain activities which invariably produce, er...loud noises, for instance, are expressly prohibited. You understand, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 旅籠の客室では、<br>「製作」「修理」などを行うことができません。
#. de: Im Zimmer sind Synthese und Reparaturen verboten.
#. fr: Il est impossible d'effectuer des synthèses ou des réparations dans les chambres.
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_SYSTEM_000_18:1"
msgid "Synthesis, repairs, and materia melding cannot be performed inside inn rooms."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この旅籠「九つの雲」は、<br>皇都「イシュガルド」での宿泊施設として、<br>旅する皆様に、ご愛顧いただいております。
#. de: Meine bescheidene Herberge erfreut sich unter den Bürgern Ishgards besonderer Beliebtheit.
#. fr: Ah, voilà une question qui me plaît<nbsp>!<br>Cette auberge est indéniablement le meilleur endroit à Ishgard pour passer une nuit reposante.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_19:1"
msgid "Well, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, some might say that Cloud Nine is an Ishgardian institution. Been here longer than most folk can remember, we have."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まるで「九つの雲」に包まれたかのような、<br>ふわふわのベッドをご用意しておりますので、<br>至福のひとときをお過ごしください。
#. de: Wir rühmen uns damit, die weichsten Betten diesseits des Schicksalswegs zu haben, und unsere Gäste neigen dazu, uns Recht zu geben.
#. fr: Tout comme le nom de “Neuf-Nuages” le suggère, nos lits sont ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment douillets. Et pour cause<nbsp>! Nous rembourrons nos matelas avec le meilleur duvet de chocobo que l'on puisse trouver en Éorzéa<nbsp>!
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_20:1"
msgid "There's some debate as to the meanin' of the name. Some say it's 'cause sleepin' in a bed of ours is like being wrapped in linens made of clouds. Others think anyone who believes that rubbish ought to try spendin' a night in the Brume."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それでは、どうぞごゆっくり、おくつろぎくださいませ。
#. de: Wie auf Wolken gebettet wirst du dich fühlen - nur eine Geld-zurück-Garantie kann ich dir darauf leider nicht geben.
#. fr: J'espère d'ailleurs que celui que nous avons installé dans votre chambre vous donnera entière sa<shy>tis<shy>fac<shy>tion.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "warp/WarpInnIshgard:TEXT_WARPINNISHGARD_BAMPONCET_000_21:1"
msgid "Me, I say a bed's a bed. I think ours are better than most, but I'm not about to get into a pissin' contest to prove it─ Er, beggin' your pardons, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>."
msgstr ""

